    },
    {
      "id": "set.permutation_invariance",
      "role": "method_property",
      "statement": "A set network's sum, mean and max pools over its present elements, its DeepSets readout and (as equivariance) each message-passing round do not depend on the order of the elements, and an absent element that stays absent does not change the pool; given that every element slot shares its feature's input standardisation.",
